At Tue, 7 May 2002 11:10:09 -0400 (EDT),
Adam K Kirchhoff wrote:
> 
> 
> Just a quick question for everyone :-)
> 
> Can anyone tell me if the Audigy support status has changed at all since:
> 
> http://www.geocrawler.com/lists/3/SourceForge/12350/25/7715917/

- first of all, the i/o from audigy drive is not tested.

- analog outputs work on all channels.
  there was a bug on rc1 regarding the rear output but fixed on cvs
  now.

- analog inputs work.

- 96kHz / 24bit is not supported.

thus, basically the analog i/o is almost identical with sb live.


- mpu401 works on the card.

- digital i/o is not implemented.
  there is a switch to toggle, but apparently not working.


